      "text": "On Day 23: from about 06:45 to 07:15 I was at home; around 07:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:00 I was at the mill; around 16:04 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:00 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:11 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at the grocery.",
