      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 06:45 to 08:00 I was at home; around 08:07 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:15 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:15 I passed through the square; from about 14:15 to 15:15 I was at the grocery; around 15:10 I passed through the square; around 15:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 15:15 to 18:00 I was at home.",
