      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 06:45 to 07:15 I was at home; around 07:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 18:00 I was at home.",
